peaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-13d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-13d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"另外，Narcissu系列每作的插画负责人（主画师）都不同，\n但设定插画主要由2人负责，多为ごとＰ。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1d9","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1d9"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"相比起初期，濑津美老师显得更幼齿，更漂亮，\n这个时期的濑津美因此有很多不同的地方。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-265","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-265"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……仔细想一下，同样的角色画了10年的话，\n这也是理所当然的事吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-32e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-32e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・濑津美：CV 綾川りの","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-35b","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-35b"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"Narcissu系列女主角一样的角色。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-3a8","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-3a8"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"性格为无口，不怎么表现出感情。\n口头禅是“无所谓（別に）……”","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-40c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-40c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"但在系列后期确实是，变得很能说了。\n在四格漫画中登场时，被称为濑津美老师。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-49a","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-49a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"喜欢的食物是炸薯条。\n喜欢的人是母亲。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-53b","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-53b"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・姬子：CV やなせなつみ","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-56a","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-56a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"N2的女主角，给了濑津美很大的影响。\n可以说是全系列关键人物般的存在。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-5f4","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-5f4"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"虔诚的天主教徒。医院的护工。\n性格开朗，十分的聪明。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-66a","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-66a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"持有国内A级执照的汽车迷。\n爱车是Eunos Roadster（即马自达 MX-5，Eunos是马自达于日本设立的三个子品牌之一，日本人所说的Roadster通常是特指马自达mx-5）。马自达信徒。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-727","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-727"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・优花：CV 岩居由希子","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-754","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-754"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"姬子的挚友。小小只的可爱女性。\n东京都内工作的OL。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-7b4","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-7b4"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"曾经性格腼腆，在与姬子共同度过最后的时间之后，\n有了一点点改变。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-826","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-826"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"爱车是从姬子那里继承的Roadster（马自达 MX-5）。\n某种意义上，是于全系列都有登场的说书人一样的存在。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-8f1","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-8f1"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・千寻：CV 後藤邑子","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-91c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-91c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"姬子的妹妹。有经验的天主教徒。\n大学毕业后作为护工活动着。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-98c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-98c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"恬静的，为姐姐着想的温柔性格。\n对待任何人都真诚相待。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-9ee","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-9ee"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"唯一被托付了这些规则的7F居民以外的人。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-a7e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-a7e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・莳绘：CV 原口馨","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-aa7","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-aa7"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"创造出作为故事舞台的医院7F的人。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-ae0","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-ae0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"年轻时是在家族经营的老人院工作的青年，\n但因为与阳子的相遇变得以成为医生为目标。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-b68","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-b68"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"当年的爱车是Savanna RX-7。他也是马自达信徒。\n现在担任医院的执行董事。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-bdc","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-bdc"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"也是从濑津美处接受书本捐赠的人物。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-c6c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-c6c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・蒔絵女儿：CV 森村なみ","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-c99","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-c99"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"莳绘的女儿。24岁。\n担任医院的综合接待。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-cef","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-cef"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"性格有点不太可靠但很有行动力。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-d28","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-d28"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在小说版的Narcissu中，二人从医院消失时，\n曾与优花一起追在二人身后。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-d96","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-d96"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"与濑津美的母亲关系很好，\n工作结束之后经常碰面。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-e41","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-e41"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・阿东：CV 中村圭佑","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-e6c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-e6c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"N1的主人公。\n与濑津美一起，向着淡路岛进发。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-ec8","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-ec8"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"性格是十分普通的20岁青年。大学生。\n取得驾照后，马上入院并在半年之后转到了7F。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-f48","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-f48"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"爱车是父亲的Integra Type-R 双座轿跑。\n在故事后半，有着喜欢上了濑津美的描写。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1013","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1013"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・阳子：CV 友永朱音","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-103e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-103e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"N0的女主角，7F最初的入院患者。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1085","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1085"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"学生时代，曾与莳绘一同活动。\n同样有着在老人院工作的经验，想要成为医生。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1101","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1101"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"由她手中诞生了7F的规则。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1185","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1185"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・濑津美母亲：CV 田中涼子","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-11b4","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-11b4"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"濑津美的母亲。\n在任职的便当店负责油炸食品的工作。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-121a","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-121a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"很担心女儿，同时又很善解人意的温柔母亲。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1263","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1263"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在濑津美去世之后，也时常与莳绘女儿\n一起去吃晚饭。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1326","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1326"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・女孩子：CV 能登麻美子","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1355","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1355"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"姬子曾经负责的7F住院患者。8岁。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1396","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1396"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"双亲也已去世，完全无依无靠的孩子。\n跟其他孩子一样纯真无邪。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1402","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1402"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"因此姬子才会被什么也做不到的无力感所囚禁。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1498","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1498"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・紫阳花（堇）：CV もな","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-14c1","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-14c1"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"新Narcissu的女主角。22岁。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-14f4","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-14f4"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"12岁开始家里蹲，14岁成为病人，\n22岁来到7F。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1562","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1562"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这中间，除了打游戏之外什么事都没做过。\n外表娇小可爱，性格有些内向。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-15e0","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-15e0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"与岁数相差很大的双亲，以及同样岁数相差很大的哥哥组成了4人家庭。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1670","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1670"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・明里：CV やなせなつみ","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-16a1","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-16a1"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"并非现实，而是选择了闭上眼的世界的女主角。22岁。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-16ee","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-16ee"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"8岁开始为装病而持续装睡，现在也在住院中。\n因为父亲是有名的资产家，所以无人因此责备她。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1776","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1776"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"16岁时，偶然间与优花和堇相遇了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1804","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1804"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・堇母亲：CV 田口宏子","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1833","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1833"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"堇的母亲。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-185c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-185c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"本来是很开朗乐天的性格，\n在女儿生病之后变得有些消极。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-18e0","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-18e0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"虽然觉得很寂寞，但无法说出口。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1974","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1974"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・健酱","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1995","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1995"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"曾经，明里唯一的朋友。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-19d0","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-19d0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"虽然是开朗，无忧无虑的笨蛋小孩性格，\n但也有着自然不做作的温柔。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1a6b","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1a6b"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"◎番外角色","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1ac0","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1ac0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・堇","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1adf","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1adf"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"明里偶然间，在巴士站遇到的女孩子。\n非常内向，孤孤单单的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1b47","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1b47"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"接受了明里的忠告，稍微变得开朗了一些。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1bd5","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1bd5"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・伊莉丝：CV 平井理子","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1c02","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1c02"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"以中世纪为舞台的Narcissu3的女主角。通称公主殿下。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1c49","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1c49"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"有着十分残酷的过去，虽然以自我为中心，\n但本来是很老实的普通女孩子。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1cbb","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1cbb"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"因为与约翰的相遇，\n开始谨慎的考虑起了平稳的生活。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1d74","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1d74"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・希未老师","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1d97","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1d97"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"四格漫画中登场的濑津美老师的拍档。\n猫猫社的《SA·NA·RA·RA》中的女主角。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1e09","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1e09"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"看起来在这个世界里，二人似乎生活在一起。\n Stage-nana的书，貌似都是由二人亲手所做的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1ed7","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1ed7"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"■Narcissu时间序列","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1f02","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1f02"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"并非按照发售顺序，而是按照游戏内的时间轴排序，\n概括性的简单一览。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1f9a","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1f9a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・Narcissu 0 —ZERO","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-1fc9","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1fc9"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"30多年前，\n作为舞台的医院7F诞生。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-204d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-204d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・Narcissu 2nd","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-2078","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2078"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"大约7年前。濑津美15岁。\n 与作为7F住院患者姬子的交流。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-2106","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2106"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・姬子 终章","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-212d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-212d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在那之后3个月。姬子与优花的交流。秋天~冬天。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-2198","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2198"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"・Narcissu 堇","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/omake\",\"main\"]/mjo-21c5"